answer:
Step 1: Calculate miles per gallon:  
\[
\text{Miles per gallon} = \frac{192 \text{ miles}}{6 \text{ gallons}} = 32 \text{ miles/gallon}
\]

Step 2: Multiply miles per gallon by 8 gallons:  
